ions, terminated and truncated separately.",[1645,1646,1647],"Compare seeded door-and-key success rates with a fixed action budget.","Modify an environment rule, then check reset, observations and goal completion.","Test BabyAI instructions while withholding hidden map state.","Built for agent research. Preserve license notices; explicitly separate rendered pixels, symbolic observations and mission text in each evaluation.",[1650,1651,1652],{"_42":1657,"_24":1658},{"_42":1655,"_24":1656},{"_42":1653,"_24":1654},"Pinned RGB visibility and wrapper implementation","https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid/blob/7f5853792ea7f04f75614661006d87fcf949f26d/minigrid/wrappers.py","Observation wrappers","https://minigrid.farama.org/api/wrappers/","Installation and BabyAI tasks","https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid#readme",[1660],{"_42":240,"_24":1661},"https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid/blob/main/LICENSE","Use bundled procedural grid rendering; added images and datasets need their own provenance.","Apache-2.0 in the current repository.",[1665],{"_42":1530,"_24":1666,"_259":1667},"https://minigrid.farama.org/","Install minigrid locally; no commercial game or model API is required.",[1669],{"_42":261,"_24":1670},"https://github.com/Farama-Foundation/Minigrid","Python · Gymnasium · discrete grid worlds",[824],[141,108],[143,110],[836],{"_42":1530,"_24":1666,"_259":1667},[1680,1681,1682],[1645,1646,1647],[1641,1642,1643],{"_42":1657,"_24":1658},{"_42":1655,"_24":1656},{"_42":1653,"_24":1654},"testing:unreal-lyra","unreal-lyra","Unreal Engine Lyra Starter Game","An official multiplayer starter game for ability systems, input, game-feature plugins, character animation and larger engine integration tasks.","/testing/unreal-lyra/",{"_18":1684,"_20":1685,"_16":1742,"_275":1743,"_271":1744,"_268":1738,"_278":1686,"_263":1727,"_256":1745,"_253":1731,"_250":1730,"_246":1264,"_242":1725,"_233":1746,"_230":1717,"_225":1747,"_219":1748,"_213":1708,"_210":209},[1690,1