_52":2427,"_46":271,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":266,"_44":2426,"_46":268,"_48":49},{"_40":50,"_42":261,"_52":2424,"_46":263,"_48":-7},{"_40":50,"_42":254,"_52":2421,"_46":256,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":251,"_44":2420,"_46":253,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":248,"_44":2419,"_46":250,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":244,"_44":937,"_46":246,"_48":247},{"_40":50,"_42":240,"_52":2417,"_46":242,"_48":-7},{"_40":50,"_42":231,"_52":2408,"_46":233,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":228,"_44":2407,"_46":230,"_48":49},{"_40":214,"_42":222,"_216":223,"_52":2403,"_46":225,"_48":-7},{"_40":214,"_42":215,"_216":217,"_52":2399,"_46":219,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":211,"_44":2398,"_46":213,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":208,"_44":209,"_46":210,"_48":75},"Not installed or run in this research pass. General campaign progress is a broad, variable target; a saved state and bounded scenario are needed for comparable scores.",[2400,2401,2402],"Install the free release and preserve a baseline save and settings.","Use a separate plugin directory for content changes; follow the repository instructions for C++ changes.","Define a bounded mission with fixed starting resources and record the game version.",[2404,2405,2406],"Create a small plugin with a mission, dialogue and explicit success condition.","Evaluate route choice, fuel management and trading from a fixed saved state.","Modify a combat or mission rule and verify save compatibility and task completion.","Use the copyright inventory when selecting artwork or audio for an exported test dataset. A free game download does not combine all of its materials into one license.",[2409,2410,2411],{"_42":2415,"_24":2416},{"_42":1866,"_24":2414},{"_42":2412,"_24":2413},"Code and asset copyright inventory","https://github.com/endless-sky/endless-sky/blob/master/copyright","https://store.steampowered.com/app/404410/Endless_Sky/","Official source and build instructions","https://github.com/endless-sky/endless-sky",[2418],{"_42":240,"_24":2413},"Multiple artwork and audio licenses; the repository copyright file identifies authors and terms.","GPLv3; third-party code and files may have their own notices.",[2422],{"_42":1878,"_24":2414,"_259":2423},"Free Steam and desktop releases; plugins offer a lighter starting point than rebuilding the engine.",[2425],{"_42":261,"_24":2416},"C++ / space exploration / data-driven content",[824],[141,108],[143,110],[836],{"_42":1878,"_24":2414,"_259":2423},[2435,2436,2437],[2404,2405,2406],[2400,2401,2402],{"_42":2415,"_24":2416},{"_42":1866,"_24":2414},{"_42":2412,"_24":2413},"testing:supertux","A complete platform game for jump timing, collision, level editing and visual/input regression tasks in a substantial native codebase.",{"_18":145,"_20":135,"_16":1742,"_275":2493,"_271":2494,"_268":2490,"_278":2439,"_263":2478,"_256":2495,"_253":2482,"_250":2481,"_246":952,"_242":2478,"_233":2496,"_230":2469,"_225":2497,"_219":2498,"_213":2460,"_210":209},[2442,2443,2444,2445,2446,2447,2448,2449,2450,2451,2452,2453,2454,2455,2456,2457,2458,2459],{"_40":20,"_44":135,"_46":20,"_48":-7},{"_40":70,"_44":2439,"_46":278,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":276,"_44":1741,"_46":16,"_48":75},{"_40":214,"_42":273,"_216":223,"_52":2492,"_46":275,"_48":-7},{"_40":214,"_42":269,"_216":223,"_52":2491,"_46":271,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":266,"_44":2490,"_46":268,"_48":49},{"_40":50,"_42":261,"_52":2488,"_46":263,"_48":-7},{"_40":50,"_42":254,"_52":2483,"_46":256,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":251,"_44":2482,"_46":253,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":248,"_44":2481,"_46":250,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":244,"_44":937,"_46":246,"_48":247},{"_40":50,"_42":240,"_52":2479,"_46":242,"_48":-7},{"_40":50,"_42":231,"_52":2470,"_46":233,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":228,"_44":2469,"_46":230,"_48":49},{"_40":214,"_42":222,"_216":223,"_52":2465,"_46":225,"_48":-7},{"_40":214,"_42":215,"_216":217,"_52":2461,"_46":219,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":211,"_44":2460,"_46":213,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":208,"_44":209,"_46":210,"_48":75},"Not installed or run in this research pass. It has no ready-made Gymnasium evaluation contract; observation, action timing and reset/success detection need a harness.",[2462,2463,2464],"Start with the free binary and a fixed level to establish a control baseline.","For code edits, follow the repository build instructions with CMake and the required C++ dependencies.","Pin the game version, level, settings and input timing before comparing agents.",[2466,2467,2468],"Modify jump acceleration or a collision edge case, then replay a fixed level.","Measure completion rate, deaths, missed jumps and time for a screen-based controller.","Change a level and verify checkpoints, enemies and completion conditions.","Code access supports instrumented experiments, but GPL code and CC BY-SA game data carry different obligations. Keep any redistributed screenshots, maps or data exports traceable to their source licenses.",[2471,2472,2473],{"_42":2477,"_24":2478},{"_42":1866,"_24":2476},{"_42":2474,"_24":2475},"Independent downloads","https://www.supertux.org/download.html","https://store.steampowered.com/app/1572920/SuperTux/","Official game source and licensing","https://github.com/SuperTux/supertux",[2480],{"_42":240,"_24":2478},"Most game data uses CC BY-SA; individual files and third-party components have additional notices.","GNU GPL; inspect the pinned version and component notices before distributing a modified build.",[2484],{"_42":2485,"_24":2486,"_259":2487},"Play official browser build","https://play.supertux.org/","Official browser play, a free Steam release and independent desktop downloads are available. Building modified core code requires the native toolchain.",[2489],{"_42":261,"_24":2478},"C++ / CMake / 2D platformer",[824],[141,108],[143,110],[836],{"_42":2485,"_24":2486,"_259":2487},[2499,2500,2501],[2466,2467,2468],[2462,2463,2464],{"_42":2477,"_24":2478},{"_42":1866,"_24":2476},{"_42":2474,"_24":2475},"testing:godot-demos","Small, separate engine projects for character control, physics, navigation, networking, animation and import/export regression tests.",{"_18":144,"_20":137,"_16":1742,"_275":2556,"_271":2557,"_268":2553,"_278":2503,"_263":2542,"_256":2558,"_253":2546,"_250":2545,"_246":408,"_242":2538,"_233":2559,"_230":2533,"_225":2560,"_219":2561,"_213":2524,"_210":209},[2506,2507,2508,2509,2510,2511,2512,2513,2514,2515,2516,2517,2518,2519,2520,2521,2522,2523],{"_40":20,"_44":137,"_46":20,"_48":-7},{"_40":70,"_44":2503,"_46":278,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":276,"_44":1741,"_46":16,"_48":75},{"_40":214,"_42":273,"_216":223,"_52":2555,"_46":275,"_48":-7},{"_40":214,"_42":269,"_216":223,"_52":2554,"_46":271,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":266,"_44":2553,"_46":268,"_48":49},{"_40":50,"_42":261,"_52":2551,"_46":263,"_48":-7},{"_40":50,"_42":254,"_52":2547,"_46":256,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":251,"_44":2546,"_46":253,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":248,"_44":2545,"_46":250,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":244,"_44":394,"_46":246,"_48":247},{"_40":50,"_42":240,"_52":2543,"_46":242,"_48":-7},{"_40":50,"_42":231,"_52":2534,"_46":233,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":228,"_44":2533,"_46":230,"_48":49},{"_40":214,"_42":222,"_216":223,"_52":2529,"_46":225,"_48":-7},{"_40":214,"_42":215,"_216":217,"_52":2525,"_46":219,"_48":-7},{"_40":41,"_42":211,"_44":2524,"_46":213,"_48":49},{"_40":41,"_42":208,"_44":209,"_46":210,"_48":75},"Not installed or run in this research pass. Hosted web demos redeploy from master on every commit, so their URLs are not immutable baselines. Pin a compatible source commit for repeatable tests; the development branch and web renderer can differ from stable desktop behavior.",[2526,2527,2528],"Choose a stable demo branch or release compatible with the installed Godot version; pin its commit.","Download one demo directory, import its project.godot and run its main scene.","Save the engine version, scene, input sequence and expected result alongside the baseline.",[2530,2531,2532],"Change one movement or collision rule and verify the original scene still starts and completes its objective.","Import a known model or animation, then compare material loading, scale, skeleton mapping and exported behavior.","Replay the same input sequence and record screenshots, errors and task completion.","A useful open-license baseline for code editing and automated playtests. Record licenses of any additional assets or plugins rather than treating the demo license as a grant for unrelated data.",[2535,2536,2537],{"_42":2541,"_24":2542},{"_42":2539,"_24":2540},{"_42":2208,"_24":2538},"https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/blob/master/LICENSE.md","Official browser builds","https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/","Official source and branch guidance","https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects",[2544],{"_42":240,"_24":2538},"Repository MIT license applies unless an individual demo or bundled resource states otherwise; keep local attribution notices.","MIT; retain the repository license and notices.",[2548],{"_42":2549,"_24":2540,"_259":2550},"Play browser demos","Free browser builds and downloadable source projects. Browser exports cover a subset of the repository.",[2552],{"_42":261,"_24":2542},"Godot / GDScript / C#",[824,272],[141,108,73],[143,110,77],[836,289],{"_42":2549,"_24":2540,"_259":2550},[2562,2563,2564],[2530,2531,2532],[2526,2527,2528],{"_42":2541,"_24":2542},{"_42":2539,"_24":2540},{"_42":2208,"_24":2538},{"_2566":2567},"documents",{"_2568":2569,"_2570":2571},"en",[2573,2577,2578,2579,2576,2580,2581,2582,2583,2584,2585,2586,2587,2588,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597,2598,2599,2600,2601,2602,2603,2604,2605,2606,2607,2608,2609,2610,2611,2575,2612,2574,2613,2614,2615,2616,2617,2618,2619,2620,2621,2622,2623,2624,2625,2626,2627,2628,2629,2630,2631,2632,2633],"zh",[2572,2573,2574,2575,2576],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-reposito